          "en": "Breakfast. Excursion to the Wadi Rum desert and 4x4 vehicle ride. We will venture into the pink sands of this desert, which has a special charm provided by the granite rock formations that nature has shaped into whimsical forms. Then transfer to Wadi Rum. Rest of the day free. Dinner and accommodation at the camp.",
